  "goodToKnow": "Die Zeremonie is a ceremony: die Trauzeremonie (wedding ceremony), die Eröffnungszeremonie, die Preisverleihung. In Germany, only a civil marriage at the Standesamt is legally valid; church ceremonies are optional. Stressed on the last syllable: tse-re-mo-NEE; the plural Zeremonien has four syllables: -NEE-en. Zeremoniell means ceremonial, and das Zeremoniell is formal protocol."
